# Google Ads Conversion Tracking Environment Variables
#
# Add these to your Vercel project settings (Settings > Environment Variables)
# Or add to your local .env.local file for testing
#
# Get these values from:
# Google Ads > Tools & Settings > Measurement > Conversions
# Click on each conversion action to see the conversion ID and label

# Your Google Ads Conversion ID (format: AW-XXXXXXXXXX)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_CONVERSION_ID=AW-XXXXXXXXXX

# Conversion Labels for each event:

# Purchase conversion (when customer completes checkout)
# This is your PRIMARY conversion - most important!
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_LABEL_PURCHASE=XXXXXXXXXXXX

# Add to cart conversion (when user uploads pet photo)
# Used for creating "add-to-cart abandoners" remarketing audience
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_LABEL_ADD_TO_CART=XXXXXXXXXXXX

# Begin checkout conversion (when user clicks "Proceed to Checkout")
# Used for creating "checkout initiators" remarketing audience
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_LABEL_BEGIN_CHECKOUT=XXXXXXXXXXXX

# Optional: Page view conversion (for remarketing)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_LABEL_PAGE_VIEW=XXXXXXXXXXXX

# ============================================================================
# HOW TO GET THESE VALUES:
# ============================================================================
#
# 1. Go to Google Ads: https://ads.google.com
# 2. Click Tools & Settings (wrench icon)
# 3. Under "Measurement", click "Conversions"
# 4. Click "New conversion action"
# 5. Choose "Website"
# 6. Create 4 conversion actions:
#    - Purchase (Category: Purchase, Value: Transaction-specific)
#    - Add to Cart (Category: Add to cart, Value: Use same value)
#    - Begin Checkout (Category: Begin checkout, Value: Use same value)
#    - Page View (Category: Page view, Value: Don't use a value)
#
# 7. After creating each conversion:
#    - Click "Setup" > "Use Google tag manager or install manually"
#    - Copy the Conversion ID (AW-XXXXXXXXXX)
#    - Copy the Conversion Label (XXXXXXXXXXXX)
#    - The format is: gtag('event', 'conversion', {'send_to': 'AW-123456789/AbC-DeF123456_67890'});
#      ↑ Conversion ID ----^          ↑ Label ------^
#
# ============================================================================
# VERIFICATION:
# ============================================================================
#
# After adding these env vars and deploying:
#
# 1. Make a test purchase on your site
# 2. Go to Google Ads > Tools > Conversions
# 3. Check if the conversion appears (may take a few minutes)
# 4. Use Google Tag Assistant Chrome extension to verify tracking fires
#
# ============================================================================
